(This contract implements a time-based vesting mechanism for QVEST tokens but has several security concerns.) Tj
T* (Most critically, it lacks any quantum-safe cryptographic implementation, making it vulnerable to future quantum) Tj
T* (attacks. Additionally, there are potential reentrancy risks in the cross-VM interaction and some logic issues in) Tj
T* (vesting calculations. The contract also has centralized ownership risks and lacks comprehensive input validation.) Tj
